#: ../../groupware/sync_kde.rst:3
msgid "Synchronizing with KDE Kontact"
msgstr "Ag sioncronú le KDE Kontact"

#: ../../groupware/sync_kde.rst:5
msgid ""
"KOrganizer, Kalendar and KAddressBook can synchronize your calendar, "
"contacts and tasks with a Nextcloud server."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir le KOrganizer, Kalendar agus KAddressBook d’fhéilire, do "
"theagmhálaithe agus do thascanna a shioncronú le freastalaí Nextcloud."

#: ../../groupware/sync_kde.rst:7
msgid ""
"This can be done by following these steps depending on if you use KOrganizer"
" or Kalendar:"
msgstr ""
"Is féidir é seo a dhéanamh trí na céimeanna seo a leanúint ag brath ar má "
"úsáideann tú KOrganizer nó Kalendar:"

#: ../../groupware/sync_kde.rst:9
msgid "In KOrganizer:"
msgstr "In KOrganizer:"

#: ../../groupware/sync_kde.rst:11
msgid ""
"Open KOrganizer and in the **Calendar** list on the left right-click and "
"choose ``Add Calendar``:"
msgstr ""
"Oscail KOrganizer agus, sa liosta **Féilire** ar thaobh na láimhe clé, "
"cliceáil ar dheis agus roghnaigh ``Cuir Féilire leis``:"

#: ../../groupware/sync_kde.rst:13
msgid "KOrganizer calendar list context menu with Add option"
msgstr ""
"Roghchlár comhthéacs do liosta féilirí KOrganizer, leis an rogha 'Cuir leis'"

#: ../../groupware/sync_kde.rst:16 ../../groupware/sync_kde.rst:28
msgid "In the resulting list of resources, pick ``DAV groupware resource``:"
msgstr ""
"Sa liosta acmhainní mar thoradh air seo, roghnaigh `` acmhainn grúpearraí "
"DAV``:"

#: ../../groupware/sync_kde.rst:18
msgid "KOrganizer resource type list with DAV groupware resource selected"
msgstr ""
"Liosta de chineálacha acmhainní KOrganizer, agus acmhainn bogearraí "
"comhoibrithe DAV roghnaithe"

#: ../../groupware/sync_kde.rst:21
msgid "In Kalendar:"
msgstr "In Kalendar:"

#: ../../groupware/sync_kde.rst:23
msgid ""
"Open Kalendar and in the menu bar open the setting and then choose "
"``Calendar Sources`` -> ``Add Calendar``:"
msgstr ""
"Oscail Kalendar agus sa bharra roghchláir oscail an socrú agus ansin "
"roghnaigh `` Foinsí Féilire`` -> ``Cuir Féilire``:"

#: ../../groupware/sync_kde.rst:25
msgid "Kalendar settings menu showing Add Calendar option"
msgstr ""
"Roghchlár socruithe féilire ina dtaispeántar an rogha 'Cuir féilire leis'"

#: ../../groupware/sync_kde.rst:30
msgid "Kalendar resource selection dialog with DAV groupware resource option"
msgstr ""
"Dialóg roghnaithe acmhainní Kalendar, le rogha d’acmhainní bogearraí "
"comhoibrithe DAV"

#: ../../groupware/sync_kde.rst:33
msgid "In KOrganizer and Kalendar:"
msgstr "In KOrganizer and Kalendar:"

#: ../../groupware/sync_kde.rst:35
msgid ""
"Enter your username. As password, you need to generate an app-password/token"
" (:ref:`Learn more <managing_devices>`):"
msgstr ""
"Cuir isteach d’ainm úsáideora. Mar phasfhocal, ní mór duit pasfhocal "
"aipe/comhartha a ghiniúint (:ref:`Tuilleadh eolais <managing_devices>`):"

#: ../../groupware/sync_kde.rst:37
msgid "KOrganizer credentials dialog for entering username and app password"
msgstr ""
"Dialóg dintiúirí KOrganizer chun ainm úsáideora agus pasfhocal feidhmchláir "
"a chur isteach"

#: ../../groupware/sync_kde.rst:40
msgid "Choose ``Nextcloud`` as Groupware server option:"
msgstr "Roghnaigh ``Nextcloud`` mar rogha fhreastalaí Groupware:"

#: ../../groupware/sync_kde.rst:42
msgid "KOrganizer groupware server selection showing Nextcloud option"
msgstr ""
"Roghnú freastalaí bogearraí grúpa i KOrganizer, leis an rogha Nextcloud ar "
"taispeáint"

#: ../../groupware/sync_kde.rst:45
msgid ""
"Enter your Nextcloud server URL and, if needed, installation path (anything "
"that comes after the first /, for example ``mynextcloud`` in "
"``https://example.com/mynextcloud``). Then click next:"
msgstr ""
"Cuir isteach URL do fhreastalaí Nextcloud agus, más gá, cosán suiteála (rud "
"ar bith a thagann tar éis an chéad /, mar shampla ``mynextcloud`` in "
"``https://example.com/mynextcloud``). Ansin cliceáil seo chugainn:"

#: ../../groupware/sync_kde.rst:47
msgid "KOrganizer server URL configuration dialog"
msgstr "Dialóg chumraíochta URL freastalaí KOrganizer"

#: ../../groupware/sync_kde.rst:50
msgid ""
"You can now test the connection, which can take some time for the initial "
"connection. If it does not work, you can go back and try to fix it with "
"other settings:"
msgstr ""
"Is féidir leat an nasc a thástáil anois, rud a fhéadfaidh roinnt ama a "
"thógáil don nasc tosaigh. Mura n-oibríonn sé, is féidir leat dul ar ais agus"
" iarracht a dhéanamh é a shocrú le socruithe eile:"

#: ../../groupware/sync_kde.rst:52
msgid "KOrganizer connection test in progress"
msgstr "Tástáil cheangail KOrganizer ar siúl"

#: ../../groupware/sync_kde.rst:55
msgid "KOrganizer successful connection test result"
msgstr "Toradh rathúil ar thástáil naisc i KOrganizer"

#: ../../groupware/sync_kde.rst:58
msgid ""
"Pick a name for this resource, for example ``Work`` or ``Home``. By default,"
" both CalDAV (Calendar) and CardDAV (Contacts) are synced:"
msgstr ""
"Roghnaigh ainm don acmhainn seo, mar shampla ``Obair`` nó ``Baile``. De réir"
" réamhshocraithe, déantar CalDAV (Féilire) agus CardDAV (Teagmhálacha) a "
"shioncronú:"

#: ../../groupware/sync_kde.rst:60
msgid "KOrganizer resource naming and calendar selection dialog"
msgstr "Dialóg chun acmhainní a ainmniú agus féilirí a roghnú i KOrganizer"

#: ../../groupware/sync_kde.rst:63
msgid ""
"You can set a manual refresh rate for your calendar and contacts resources. "
"By default this setting is set to 5 minutes and should be fine for the most "
"use cases. When you create a new appointment it is synced to Nextcloud right"
" away. You may want to change this for saving your power or cellular data "
"plan, so that you can update with a right-click on the item in the calendar "
"list."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir leat ráta athnuachana láimhe a shocrú le haghaidh d’acmhainní "
"féilire agus teagmhálaithe. De réir réamhshocraithe tá an socrú seo "
"socraithe go 5 nóiméad agus ba cheart go mbeadh sé ceart go leor sna cásanna"
" is mó úsáide. Nuair a chruthaíonn tú coinne nua déantar é a shioncronú le "
"Nextcloud láithreach. B'fhéidir gur mhaith leat é seo a athrú chun do "
"chumhacht nó do phlean sonraí ceallacha a shábháil, ionas gur féidir leat "
"nuashonrú le cliceáil ar dheis ar an mír sa liosta féilire."

#: ../../groupware/sync_kde.rst:65
msgid ""
"After a few seconds to minutes depending on your internet connection, you "
"will find your calendars and contacts inside the KDE Kontact applications "
"KOrganizer, Kalendar and KAddressBook as well as Plasma calendar applet:"
msgstr ""
"Tar éis cúpla soicind go nóiméid ag brath ar do nasc idirlín, gheobhaidh tú "
"do chuid féilirí agus teagmhálaithe laistigh d'fheidhmchláir KDE Kontact "
"KOrganizer, Kalendar agus KAddressBook chomh maith le feidhmchláirín féilire"
" Plasma:"

#: ../../groupware/sync_kde.rst:67
msgid "KOrganizer calendar application showing synchronized Nextcloud events"
msgstr ""
"Feidhmchlár féilire KOrganizer ag taispeáint imeachtaí Nextcloud "
"sioncronaithe"

#: ../../groupware/sync_kde.rst:69
msgid ""
"KDE Plasma desktop with Nextcloud calendar events in the system calendar "
"widget"
msgstr ""
"Deasc KDE Plasma le himeachtaí féilire Nextcloud sa ghiuirléid féilire "
"córais"

#: ../../groupware/sync_kde.rst:71
msgid "Kalendar month view showing synchronized Nextcloud calendar events"
msgstr ""
"Amharc míosa féilire ina dtaispeántar imeachtaí féilire Nextcloud atá "
"sioncronaithe"

#: ../../groupware/sync_kde.rst:73
msgid ""
"KAddressBook contacts application showing synchronized Nextcloud contacts"
msgstr ""
"Feidhmchlár teagmhálaithe KAddressBook ag taispeáint teagmhálaithe Nextcloud"
" atá sioncronaithe"
